From 246084c93209a5f96dbc5fca0e8796315700a9a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:47:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 05/13] Round 5: Build IF97 power tables from short independent
 chains

Reduced-temperature and pressure power tables were built as one long
chain of dependent multiplications (58 steps for Region 2). Build the
first eight powers by squaring and every later one as x^(k-8) * x^8, so
eight independent chains of at most seven steps replace the long chain
with the same number of multiplications. Values change in the last bits.

Workload: serial (96 candidates, one worker), matrix API both sides.
Official 11-sample run: 0.674 ms -> 0.389 ms, 1.73x (paired 1.79x).
41-sample confirmation: 0.489 ms -> 0.288 ms, paired 1.68x.
validate.py passed against the release CLI.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
